     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><br>I am just starting out with shinyapps and have a problem trying to publish to <a href=\"http://shinyapp.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapp.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360227796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aUiOYjRtA0yjPt_d5IUDb\">shinyapp.io</a>. My app works fine on my local machine.<br><br>I have a package, just the one, that has a dependency that cannot be fetched from CRAN.<br><br>The package I call: library(&quot;bipartite&quot;)<br><br>error message:<br><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;!important;font-size:10pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;box-sizing:border-box;width:909px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Error: Unhandled Exception: Child Task 504936827 failed: Error building image: Error fetching mgcv (1.8-23) source. &lt;CRANPackageSource repo=&#39;<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792360227796000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1qMnnjeZ5jLs8f3IqxEBWI\">http://cran.rstudio.org</a>&#39;&gt; unable to satisfy package: mgcv (1.8-23)\r\nExecution halted</span></pre><br>I am on a windows 7 (64bit) machine, using Rstudio <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(243,244,244)\">Version</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(243,244,244);display:inline!important;float:none\"><span> </span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(243,244,244)\">1.1.383<br></span><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">R version 3.4.3 (2017-11-30) -- &quot;Kite-Eating Tree&quot;<br>bipartite 2.08<br>(I have up-dated everything in the hope it would help).<br><br>Any help would be greatly appreciated</span></span></pre><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:15px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span><span style=\"outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"></span></span></pre><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;;font-size