   "subject": "Re: Error building image: Error fetching mgcv (1.8-23) source.",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I tracked this down to mgcv having two entries in the CRAN PACKAGES index, the additional one being for R 3.5 which specifies 1.8-22.<div>This entry and the difference in version is triggering a code path that has us building an incorrect download URL for the package, which is why this is failing.</div><div>I am trying to determine an appropriate work around or fix and will post an update when I know more.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
